<title>POLAND: Elektrobudowa Q1 net rises to PLN 4 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektrobudowa Q1 net rises to PLN 4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrobudowa preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.95 vs	5.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   5.74 vs	4.94</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.86 vs	3.26</p>
<p>    net sales				 52.73 vs     46.13</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  44.97 vs     38.95</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.00 vs	1.68</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.12 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.29 vs	0.10</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.50 vs	0.65</p>
<p>    investment				 3.35 vs	1.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is: Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
